Document.description_en:
The Kwikwasut&#39;inuxw Haxwa&#39;mis First Nation (KHFN) aims to construct a new seawall and bioengineered slope to address natural threats to&nbsp;KHFN&#39;s Village of Gwa&#39;yas&#39;dums on Gilford Island. Construction of these assets would protect critical infrastructure and services within the community, and reduce risk of population displacement due to natural hazards. Project activites would occur on the KHFN&#39;s Gwayasdums No. 1 Indian Reserve lands.&nbsp;&nbsp;

The project would involve the following components:


	Site preparation works;
	Construction of new seawall, boardwalk, and bioengineered slope;
	Excavation and installation of supporting infrastructure and associated works in project area; and
	Various restoration, drainage, and accessory works.&nbsp;

Document.description_fr:
La Premi&egrave;re Nation Kwikwasut&#39;inuxw Haxwa&#39;mis (PNKH) vise &agrave; construire une nouvelle digue et une pente bio-ing&eacute;nierie pour faire face aux menaces naturelles qui p&egrave;sent sur le village de Gwa&#39;yas&#39;dums de PNKH sur l&#39;&icirc;le Gilford. La construction de ces actifs prot&eacute;gerait les infrastructures et les services essentiels au sein de la communaut&eacute; et r&eacute;duirait le risque de d&eacute;placement de population d&ucirc; aux al&eacute;as naturels. Les activit&eacute;s du projet se d&eacute;rouleraient sur les terres de la r&eacute;serve indienne Gwayasdums n&deg; 1 de la PNKH.

Le projet comprendrait les composantes suivantes:


	Pr&eacute;paration du site;
	Construction d&#39;une nouvelle digue, d&#39;une promenade et d&#39;une pente bio-ing&eacute;nierie;
	Excavation et installation des infrastructures de soutien et travaux associ&eacute;s dans la zone du projet; et
	Divers travaux de restauration, de drainage et d&#39;accessoires.

