Document.description_en:
Vancouver Airport Authority is proposing to construct and operate three temporary construction staging sites that may be used for soil stockpiling and/or construction equipment storage and staging.&nbsp; The three areas are located on Ferguson Road on the northside of the Vancouver International Airport in Richmond.

&nbsp;

The Proposed Project

&nbsp;

The proposed YVR North Construction Yards project will involve clearing of vegetation and setup of level staging areas to stockpile soil, sort construction materials and park construction equipment. Site preparation will include vegetation clearing, removal of soil, grading, excavation, placement of gravel, construction of access driveways and installation of fencing and signage.

&nbsp;

Operation of the construction yards will involve construction equipment parking and operation, soil import, soil sorting, soil placement, bulk aggregate storage, grading, excavation and site restoration.

Document.description_fr:
Le projet d&#39;aires de chantier nord de l&#39;a&eacute;roport international de Vancouver (YVR) pr&eacute;voit le d&eacute;broussaillage et l&#39;am&eacute;nagement d&#39;aires de stationnement planes pour l&#39;entreposage de terre, le tri des mat&eacute;riaux de construction et le stationnement de l&#39;&eacute;quipement de construction. La pr&eacute;paration du site comprendra le d&eacute;broussaillage, l&#39;enl&egrave;vement de terre, le nivellement, l&#39;excavation, le d&eacute;p&ocirc;t de gravier, la construction de voies d&#39;acc&egrave;s et l&#39;installation de cl&ocirc;tures et de signalisation.

&nbsp;

L&#39;exploitation des aires de chantier comprendra le stationnement et l&#39;utilisation de l&#39;&eacute;quipement de construction, l&#39;importation, le tri et le d&eacute;p&ocirc;t de terre, l&#39;entreposage de granulats en vrac, le nivellement, l&#39;excavation et la remise en &eacute;tat du site.

