Document.description_en:
This project to repair the sanitary sewer system in Timiskaming consists of several components.&nbsp;

- Installation of a storm-water system to carry away stormwater runoff and water from building foundation drains;

- Reconstruction of existing streets to address current issues with inadequate surface drainage in the community;

- Construction of a new storm-water outfall that will discharge into the stream on the other side of Stranger Road.&nbsp;

Document.description_fr:
Ce projet de r&eacute;fection du r&eacute;seau d&#39;&eacute;gout sanitaire &agrave; Timiskaming comprend plusieurs volets.&nbsp;

- Ajout d&#39;un r&eacute;seaut d&#39;&eacute;gout pluvial permettant d&#39;&eacute;vacuer l&#39;eau de ruissellement ainsi que l&#39;eau provenant des drains de fondation des b&acirc;timents;

-Reconstruction des rues existantes afin de corriger les probl&egrave;mes actuels de drainage de surface inad&eacute;quat dans la communaut&eacute;;

-Construction d&#39;un nouvel &eacute;missaire des eaux pluviales qui se d&eacute;versera dans le ruisseau de l&#39;autre c&ocirc;t&eacute;&nbsp; de Stranger Road.&nbsp;

